# The caller provides the selected chair id for logging and traceability.
string chair_id
# The caller provides the safe pre-calibrated waist yaw for that chair.
float32 waist_yaw_rad
# The caller can request an immediate return to the home waist angle after pointing.
bool return_home
# The caller can also request only the home motion without any pointing gesture.
bool home_only
---
# The service reports whether the waist command sequence completed successfully.
bool success
# The service also returns a short human-readable status message.
string message
